  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformative Climate Resilient Agriculture to address the fuel crisis and anticipate El Nino induced risks on Farmers and Fisherfolk in Cagayan Valley (Transformative CRA Project) in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vulnerable farmers and fisherfolk in Cagayan Valley are better able to withstand and adapt to the impacts of fuel price shocks and drought-like conditions through improved access to cash-plus support, energy-efficient production and post-production technologies, climate-adaptive livelihood options, and strengthened disaster preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
